  "body": "Set of Date Sale\r\nBy 2pm, 9 December 2026 \r\n(unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned on an expansive 1,181sqm (approx.) section, 4 Matai Road offers space, flexibility, and an opportunity for first home buyers to secure a foothold in a growing coastal pocket. Strong rental return potential will also appeal to investors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs: Extensively renovated, step upstairs to experience a sunny living environment that has been updated for your comfort. Enjoy brand-new carpet, fresh flooring, and a beautifully modern bathroom. The layout features three bedrooms; the open-plan kitchen, dining and family area flows to a large tiled outdoor deck, providing an ideal setting for summer BBQs, family gatherings, and outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Flexibility: The lower level offers a further one bedroom with its own external entrance, and one bathroom, one office and a storage room. Plus, there is a lock-up garage and ample off-street parking, with space for your boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nPrime Location & Future Upside: Conveniently located just moments from local shops, schools, beaches, and public transport options. With the major Penlink infrastructure project well underway nearby, future connectivity to the North Shore and Auckland CBD will be faster and easier than ever, adding potential for long-term capital growth.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Land Size: Approx.1,181sqm land area, offering space and long-term landholding value\r\n* Upstairs Living: 3 bedrooms, one bathroom\r\n* Recent Upgrades: Bathroom, new carpet, and stylish new flooring\r\n* Outdoor Living: Tiled deck off the open-plan family area, ideal for BBQs\r\n* Downstairs Space: one bedroom, one bathroom, an office, and a storage room,  with external access\r\n* Parking: Internal garage + off-street parking\r\n* Location Highlights: Close to Stanmore Bay amenities, shops, and transport routes\r\n* Infrastructure Boost: Well positioned to benefit from the upcoming Penlink connection\r\n* Investor Appeal: Strong rental return potential\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing!\r\n*** Interior photos contain AI staging. For reference only.",
